<BR>

The pages linked below discuss several different types of algorithm
that are used to perform and analyze PS-FTS calculations, and that
are not also used for SCFT calculations. 
We focus here on explaining the different types of algorithm that 
are required, and on listing the available choices among sets of 
algorithms of each type (e.g., different available Brownian dynamics 
step algorithms).  Links to user documentation for specific 
algorithms are available via pages linked below that discuss 
particular types of algorithm.
A \ref psfts_param_page "subsequent page" is devoted to a 
description of the format of the parameter file for a PS-FTS 
calculation, including a description of locations of file
sections that specify choices for each type of algorithm.

<h2> Contents:</h2>

